refactor(admission/leads): columns read stage options from admission_statuses

Adds useLeadStageOptions() hook reading from admission_statuses, used
by the status filter dropdown. Stage colors in the cell renderer still
use hardcoded getStageColor (cell callback can't use hooks) — that
migration happens when the renderer is converted to a component.

